2. Implemented lazy loading with error handling for the ImportedComponent
3. Enhanced the i18n mock with more required methods
4. Added a mock TRPC client
5. Provided better session data to SessionProvider
6. Added global fetch mock
7. Enhanced navigation mocks with more methods
8. Added window.matchMedia mock
9. Simplified provider mocks to just render children
10. Added better QueryClient configuration
11. Removed unnecessary component mocks that might interfere with the actual implementation

The changes focus on:
- Better error handling and reporting
- More complete mocking of required dependencies
- Simplified provider structure
- Proper lazy loading with fallbacks

This should help resolve the module fetching error by providing better error handling and more complete mocking of the environment.

